{"content":[{"c":["DEATH, The Second"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Term used in the NT only in the book of Revelation, to describe God’s eternal judgment on sin. Originally a rabbinic expression, the second death will be experienced by those whose names are not written in the “Book of Life” (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.20.15","r":"Rev.20.15","rawR":"Rev.20.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.20.15","value":"Rev.20.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Rv 20:15"},"). The second death is equated with the “lake of fire” (v ",{"href":"?bref=Rev.20.14","r":"Rev.20.14","rawR":"Rev.20.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.20.14","value":"Rev.20.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"14"},"), or the lake that burns with “fire and brimstone” (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.21.8","r":"Rev.21.8","rawR":"Rev.21.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.21.8","value":"Rev.21.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"21:8"},", ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"), and is described as the lot of “the cowardly, the faithless, the polluted, . . . murderers, fornicators, sorcerers, idolaters, and all liars” (",{"c":["rsv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"). Those who are victorious in this life have nothing to fear from the second death (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.2.11","r":"Rev.2.11","rawR":"Rev.2.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.2.11","value":"Rev.2.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"2:11"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Death_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Death_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Death_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Death"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Eschatology_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Eschatology_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Eschatology_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Eschatology"},"; ",{"href":"?item=FallofMan_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"FallofMan_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"FallofMan_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Fall of Man"},"; ",{"href":"?item=LastJudgment_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"LastJudgment_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"LastJudgment_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Last Judgment"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"DeaththeSecond","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Rv 20:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.20.15","rawQueryValue":"Rev.20.15","sourceRefExact":"Rev.20.15"},{"anchorText":"14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.20.14","rawQueryValue":"Rev.20.14","sourceRefExact":"Rev.20.14"},{"anchorText":"21:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.21.8","rawQueryValue":"Rev.21.8","sourceRefExact":"Rev.21.8"},{"anchorText":"2:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.2.11","rawQueryValue":"Rev.2.11","sourceRefExact":"Rev.2.11"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e52f6c1e09ffdb2326d7a0e2b4fbc4ca6d5d95fb22f68b44402505c4e1702c99","sourceItemName":"DeaththeSecond","sourceItemOrder":51,"sourceMember":"Articles/D.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"DeaththeSecond","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Death, the Second","title":"Death, the Second","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}